  "title": "Qt: Check if mainWindow() returns a nullptr in DisplayFilterEdit",
  "description": "Our mainWindow() function returns a nullptr when the main window isn't\nvisible, e.g. when shutting down. It's possible to crash if Wireshark\nis shutdown while in the middle of reloading Lua plugins (e.g., have\na script with a long running ProgDlg with the sample code) when\ncheckDisplayFilter gets run at the end.\n\nFixup 3f83a3b36401649d129dd0352fa2732ca4288978\n\nBackporting this will need to take into account the type change\nin e1b1ef10291f9fdcbcd1b5a968867c5f062b9c49",
